WEBVTT

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:34.980
Number 25...

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:36.790
Number 27...

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:42.870
I can't find you anywhere.

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:45.410
There is no Number 26, Joe.

00:01:46.430 --> 00:01:51.240
Even without Number 26, Number 27 is shining there.

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:54.240
Guess you passed, Master Mammoth Nishi.

00:01:55.230 --> 00:01:56.380
Congratulations on becoming a pro.

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:20.160
Joe, there's no reason to get depressed over it.

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:23.540
You just have to take the test again next month.

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:26.540
Shut up! Who said I was depressed?

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:29.540
I'm sorry I passed and you didn't, Joe.

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:31.540
You see, I was expecting to fail.

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:33.540
You see, I was expecting to fail.

00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:48.770
<i>He's crazy!</i>

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:49.520
<i>Get back here!</i>

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:51.520
<i>Stop! Rope down!</i>

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:53.020
<i>You bastard!</i>

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:54.420
<i>Stop! This isn't a fight!</i>

00:02:54.420 --> 00:02:55.980
<i>Stop! Stop it!</i>

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:57.110
<i>Hold it!</i>

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:57.940
<i>Lemme go!</i>

00:02:58.740 --> 00:03:00.990
There was something wrong with me back then.

00:03:02.130 --> 00:03:03.450
That was pretty bad.

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:07.450
Hey, Yabuki-kun! Look this way, please!

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:12.460
Yabuki-kun, I'm sorry to hear that you failed the pro test!

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:14.300
Can you let us know how you're feeling now?

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:15.010
You dipshits!

00:03:15.720 --> 00:03:17.160
Who gives a fuck how I feel?

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:18.630
Put away those goddamn cameras!

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:35.350
So he failed...

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:37.590
Are you disappointed?

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:42.720
Oh, Grandpa... Even though Yabuki-kun turned you down so severely,

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:45.260
you still can't forget about him, can you?

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:46.990
You're like a jilted lover.

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:54.000
He really is something else for the papers to devote this much space over a pro test.

00:03:54.730 --> 00:03:56.900
That's because everything he does is flashy.

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:01.940
He's not just flashy.

00:04:01.940 --> 00:04:03.970
He's a man worthwhile enough to make headlines.

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:06.220
What do you mean by that?

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:12.200
I wouldn't be afraid of a man who passed the pro test with ease.

00:04:13.090 --> 00:04:15.780
But I feel terror from a rough-and-tumble man

00:04:15.780 --> 00:04:18.230
whom even the test rejects.

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:19.730
He failed the test.

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:23.010
Yabuki's really done it this time.

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:24.640
My, my...

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:28.780
I'm surprised that even you are raving on about this delirious nonsense, Rikiishi-kun.

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:32.360
Aren't you most afraid of him, Miss?

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:36.210
Now, then... I'm off to the gym to train.

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:42.220
Next time, he'll pass at his own pace.

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:46.220
If he passes the B-class test,

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:48.250
he'll be qualified to fight six-round matches,

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:51.220
without ever having to fight four-round ones.

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:55.280
He's already closing in on us.

00:04:55.280 --> 00:04:56.190
Well, then...

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:02.030
Old man...

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:03.030
What, Nishi?

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:04.530
Joe's finally done it, hasn't he?

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:07.870
Aren't you happy, old man?

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:12.560
He failed to get the B-class license the first time,

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:15.700
but he got it at his own pace this time!

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:22.510
The B-class license, eh?

00:05:22.510 --> 00:05:23.380
What next?

00:05:40.910 --> 00:05:42.080
Hey, old man...

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:43.230
What is it?

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:46.090
Joe just passed the pro test,

00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:48.660
but he doesn't look too happy about it.

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:50.670
He's just too proud.

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:54.670
He probably can't stomach the fact that a guy as skilled as him would have to be tested.

00:05:55.400 --> 00:05:57.170
What can't I stomach?

00:05:57.170 --> 00:05:58.610
N-Nothing.

00:05:59.190 --> 00:06:01.170
It's nothing you need to know about.

00:06:03.350 --> 00:06:05.070
Oh, he's back!

00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:06.670
Bro Joe!

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:13.150
Congratulations, Bro Joe!

00:06:13.150 --> 00:06:15.270
I hear you've finally passed the pro test!

00:06:16.010 --> 00:06:17.740
What? Who told you?

00:06:17.740 --> 00:06:20.730
A whole bunch of reporters came and told us!

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:21.830
Reporters?

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:23.730
They're here again?

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:27.240
It's not just the reporters! Everyone in Slum Town knows!

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:29.240
Whatever, let's just get going!

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:30.590
Come on!

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:39.840
There he is!

00:06:41.780 --> 00:06:44.760
Congratulations! Congratulations, Joe!

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:52.260
See? Everyone came!

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:55.260
Joe! Congratulations!

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:59.270
Welcome home! Lemme be the first to fill your cup!

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:01.270
Yahoo! Hooray!

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:04.230
Hey! Three cheers for the world champion!

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:06.280
Yabuki-kun!

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:13.240
Man, oh man. The people in this town will use any excuse to throw a party.

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:16.400
Hey, Nishi! Joe! Kenkichi, you're late!

00:07:17.740 --> 00:07:20.600
C'mon, Joe! Have a drink!

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:21.250
Father!

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:25.240
Father, you're always such a bad drunk!

00:07:25.240 --> 00:07:28.260
C'mon! Let's order some sushi and tempura! Let's party it up!

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:31.590
Can we wait a little before partying?

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:29.400
<i>Party!</i>

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:34.140
Where are the news reporters?

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:35.770
I heard there were a lot of them.

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:38.270
News reporters?

00:07:39.970 --> 00:07:42.630
Come to think of it, I don't see them anywhere.

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:45.230
Did they go home already?

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:52.240
They all took off.

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:53.780
Took off?

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:57.780
Well... These guys... They...

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:05.550
The reporters drove up to the bridge and waited to interview Joe...

00:08:15.100 --> 00:08:19.600
We salvaged their cars and sold the parts to buy sake and food!

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:23.600
Well, what's done is done! Nothing we can do now!

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:25.580
Y-You've gotta be kidding!

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:30.440
Well, it's got nothing to do with you! C'mon! Let's party it up!

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:34.910
Hey! Let's light some fireworks to set this place alight!

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:36.410
Oh, I've been waiting for this!

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:40.910
I made this by collecting toy fireworks just for today!

00:08:41.420 --> 00:08:43.410
You guys stand back! It's dangerous!

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:56.120
What the hell? That was more like a fart bubble in a bathtub than a firework!

00:08:56.120 --> 00:08:57.560
Oh, sorry!

00:08:57.560 --> 00:08:59.970
Goddammit... This one'll be good, just you watch!

00:09:09.660 --> 00:09:12.450
I guess I put in too much gunpowder...

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:14.640
Yeah, too much!

00:09:14.640 --> 00:09:15.280
Shut up!

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:16.450
Blockhead!

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:20.450
That's enough fireworks! Raise the banners!

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:42.010
Well? Don't they look swell?

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:44.520
Today's a special day, Danpei-san!

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:49.660
There have been so many people who have crossed the Bridge of Tears into the slums with tears in their eyes,

00:09:49.660 --> 00:09:53.840
but no one's ever crossed it with their eyes filled with hope!

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:58.590
But now three people are about to take flight!

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:00.970
There's never been any moment as joyous as this!

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:04.360
That's right! This joy is not yours alone!

00:10:04.360 --> 00:10:06.400
It's everyone's joy!

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:10.500
You're the beacons of hope for everyone in the slums!

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:11.610
Damn straight!

00:10:11.610 --> 00:10:13.080
We'll be cheering you on from the slums!

00:10:13.080 --> 00:10:14.010
That's right!

00:10:16.570 --> 00:10:18.050
Did you hear that, guys?

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:20.820
This is a big responsibility.

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:23.300
W-Well, when you put it that way...

00:10:23.300 --> 00:10:24.400
Huh, Joe?

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:46.540
Old man! Fix me a match, quick! I'm itching to fight!

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:54.010
I'm gonna beat down Rikiishi Toru in front of your very eyes!

00:10:54.010 --> 00:10:55.050
I'll do it!

00:11:12.210 --> 00:11:14.940
He's done it, just like I predicted.

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:21.610
That bastard's finally a pro boxer.

00:11:22.130 --> 00:11:24.380
Now you can fight him fair and square.

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:38.680
Welcome! Four turnips, is that everything?

00:11:38.680 --> 00:11:39.680
I'll have two of these.

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:40.900
Here you go. Thank you for your business.

00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:42.610
Could you hurry up, please?

00:11:42.610 --> 00:11:44.140
Right, right. You need pickled radish?

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:46.140
That'll be 47 yen.

00:11:46.950 --> 00:11:48.170
I'm home!

00:11:48.590 --> 00:11:49.270
Welcome home!

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:50.140
Where's Yabuki-kun?

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:51.930
He's inside, folding bags.

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:03.780
What do you think you're doing!?

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:06.820
You're not getting paid to mess around!

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:08.370
S-Sorry. I got carried away.

00:12:09.100 --> 00:12:11.370
Can't you be a little more serious?

00:12:11.920 --> 00:12:14.240
I-I got it. I'll be serious.

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:21.590
Hey, that's today's newspaper! What are you thinking!?

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:23.090
I'm home!

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:26.220
I guess not even you can stand up to my mother, Yabuki-kun!

00:12:26.860 --> 00:12:31.540
Noriko, I'm going to help out in the front, so you keep an eye on this boy.

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:32.920
Yes! I'll come out after I've changed!

00:12:32.920 --> 00:12:38.190
Seriously... How can we have more employees but still be just as busy?

00:12:38.840 --> 00:12:42.090
Hey, I'm trying to be serious...

00:12:48.040 --> 00:12:49.250
Boxing Hour!

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:50.500
Rikiishi's gonna be on TV!

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:53.390
Nori-chan, what time is it?

00:12:55.860 --> 00:12:57.250
Hey, Nori-chan?

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:01.850
You stupid pervert!

00:13:03.240 --> 00:13:04.800
Go, Rikiishi! That's the way!

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:06.220
Do an uppercut! Uppercut!

00:13:06.920 --> 00:13:08.870
Rikiishi's already on the offensive!

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:09.970
Yoshizawa can't move!

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:13.220
Yoshizawa's getting groggy! Oh, he's going for a clinch!

00:13:13.220 --> 00:13:14.020
And... Right, left!

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:16.340
Yeah, way to go, Rikiishi!

00:13:16.340 --> 00:13:17.400
Rush him!

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:23.300
Please don't get mad at him, Mother.

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:25.650
Yabuki-kun's friend is on TV.

00:13:26.600 --> 00:13:29.660
I've already done Yabuki-kun's work for him, okay?

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:33.540
And he's hit him with a right! Rikiishi throws a powerful uppercut!

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:34.660
And Yoshizawa's down!

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:35.670
Yahoo!

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:44.580
Did you see that, Nishi?

00:13:44.580 --> 00:13:46.990
Rikiishi keeps getting better and better.

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:51.180
He's established his reputation as a main event boxer.

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:55.640
At this rate, it's only a matter of time before he makes it to the Japanese featherweight ranking.

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:04.780
Once he's ranked, he can challenge the national featherweight champion.

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:09.650
Then he can use that as a springboard to become Pan-Asian or even world champion.

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:19.290
Compared to him, we've barely become pro boxers...

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:20.300
Damn!

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:27.130
I want a match right now! Eh, Nishi?

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:27.130
<i>Joe...</i>

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:29.630
We're assistants at Hayashi's now.

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:31.260
Why don't you take it seriously?

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:33.270
I know, and I don't care!

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:35.230
Damn Rikiishi!

00:14:35.230 --> 00:14:38.480
I can't just sit here while he shows off!

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:39.630
I'll go on ahead!

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:41.770
W-Wait, Joe!

00:15:01.550 --> 00:15:03.070
What are you doing, Nishi?

00:15:03.070 --> 00:15:06.300
Just get changed and start training! Hurry!

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:09.000
Hold on a second... I gotta eat something...

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:11.720
I'm so hungry I could die...

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:13.470
You're no fun.

00:15:16.900 --> 00:15:17.730
Old man!

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:19.560
Welcome home, old man!

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:23.830
I'll prepare dinner. You guys go do some roadwork.

00:15:23.830 --> 00:15:24.970
What's the deal?

00:15:24.970 --> 00:15:27.240
We did our roadwork before we got to Hayashi's!

00:15:27.240 --> 00:15:29.740
Today's different.

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:34.040
You should be happy. You've both got matches lined up!

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:37.330
R-Really?

00:15:37.890 --> 00:15:38.790
When?

00:15:39.340 --> 00:15:42.540
The 21st of next month, at Korakuen Hall.

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:45.800
Nishi, you're debuting in a four-round match, and Joe, you're in a six-round match.

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:50.050
Yahoo!

00:15:52.100 --> 00:15:54.260
So, who's my opponent?

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:56.010
His name's Murase Takeo.

00:15:56.540 --> 00:15:57.820
Murase?

00:15:57.820 --> 00:15:59.980
Never heard that name before.

00:16:00.570 --> 00:16:02.520
Well, forget about him.

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:04.520
I want to fight Wolf or Rikiishi.

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:06.590
Don't get conceited.

00:16:06.590 --> 00:16:09.030
Boxing isn't just about fighting.

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:12.000
In the ring, Wolf really is a wolf.

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:14.030
He's got dreadful claws and fangs.

00:16:15.440 --> 00:16:17.500
A wolf? He's just a mongrel...

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:19.540
Are you gonna do roadwork or not!?

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:22.540
Listen to what I say, or I'll kill you!

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:24.560
Are you kidding me!?

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:26.940
Please, don't get so violent!

00:16:28.930 --> 00:16:30.190
Congratulations, Bro Joe!

00:16:30.190 --> 00:16:31.760
Bro Joe, congratulations!

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:34.380
Congratulations.

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:36.550
I hear you both have matches.

00:16:37.830 --> 00:16:39.470
Guess news travels fast.

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:40.990
Of course!

00:16:40.990 --> 00:16:42.560
We hear about these things right away!

00:16:43.630 --> 00:16:45.520
What are you all doing here?

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:47.540
Well, congratulations, Danpei-san!

00:16:47.540 --> 00:16:49.480
The day has finally been set!

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:52.950
The day when Yabuki-kun and Nishi-kun will enter the ring!

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:56.990
My blood's rushing just thinking about it!

00:16:58.420 --> 00:17:00.700
It's only a four-round and a six-round match.

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:04.710
It's no weight on our shoulders like a world title match.

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:05.500
That's just it!

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:08.410
We need you to feel the weight on your shoulders!

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:13.750
The hopes and dreams of everyone in the slums rest on you!

00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:15.850
Do your best!

00:17:16.740 --> 00:17:19.390
I'll be cheering you on!

00:17:22.110 --> 00:17:24.590
Well, yeah... I'll do my best...

00:17:24.590 --> 00:17:27.310
Whoever this Murasa is, I can handle him.

00:17:27.920 --> 00:17:29.020
Right, Nishi?

00:17:29.640 --> 00:17:34.030
Isn't it kind of you to say that to Noriko-san?

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:36.530
Y-You idiot! It's not like that!

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:38.230
That's right, that's right!

00:17:38.230 --> 00:17:39.290
N-No!

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:41.170
Hey, he's blushing!

00:17:41.170 --> 00:17:42.040
You little brat!

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:44.620
I think the lady doth protest too much!

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:46.040
That's not it at all, idiot.

00:17:47.430 --> 00:17:48.970
That's not it.

00:17:49.850 --> 00:17:51.050
It's just...

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:58.090
I just thought about being a pro boxer.

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:04.890
I've been wandering around the world, and failed at everything I did.

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:07.440
But boxing has let me succeed at something.

00:18:08.910 --> 00:18:11.360
In other words, the world has let me become a pro.

00:18:16.250 --> 00:18:18.700
Great! I'm gonna make him my successor!

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:23.030
Hey, Noriko! Get the present we've prepared for this day!

00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:26.840
Uh... here.

00:18:26.840 --> 00:18:28.040
For Danpei-san.

00:18:30.300 --> 00:18:31.540
It's a hat!

00:18:32.300 --> 00:18:34.730
I made it out of an old one.

00:18:34.730 --> 00:18:36.970
Wow, you're so thoughtful, Noriko-san!

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:41.510
The old man's head was so defenseless!

00:18:42.230 --> 00:18:43.970
You little whippersnapper!

00:18:43.970 --> 00:18:46.490
These are for Nishi-kun and Joe-kun.

00:18:46.490 --> 00:18:48.330
Huh? For us?

00:18:48.330 --> 00:18:49.480
What's inside?

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:53.860
You can't enter a ring with training pants, can you?

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:54.760
So I got you...

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:56.820
B-B...

00:18:57.620 --> 00:18:58.900
B-Boxers.

00:19:00.630 --> 00:19:02.660
They even have our initials!

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:05.230
She's blushing! Isn't she stupid?

00:19:05.230 --> 00:19:06.830
They're called trunks.

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:09.670
You only had a hard time saying it because you called them boxers!

00:19:09.670 --> 00:19:12.170
You're so mean! Get back here!

00:19:18.180 --> 00:19:19.670
You look so cool!

00:19:19.670 --> 00:19:21.050
That's perfect!

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:23.350
Hey, world champ!

00:19:27.980 --> 00:19:31.130
Huh? What about Nishi?

00:19:31.130 --> 00:19:32.690
He's too embarrassed to come out.

00:19:32.690 --> 00:19:34.940
What's there to be embarrassed about?

00:19:35.450 --> 00:19:36.900
He's not a girl, for crying out loud!

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:38.430
Hurry and get out!

00:19:38.430 --> 00:19:41.240
Everyone wants to see you in your glory!

00:19:41.240 --> 00:19:42.210
That's easy for you to say...

00:19:42.210 --> 00:19:43.280
Come on, come on!

00:19:46.090 --> 00:19:47.160
They're sure riding high!

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:49.500
Wow, look at him!

00:19:50.690 --> 00:19:53.000
They're a little tight, Miss Noriko!

00:19:54.020 --> 00:19:55.320
I'm sorry!

00:19:55.320 --> 00:19:59.050
I tried to make them as big as I could, but I'll fix them later!

00:19:59.470 --> 00:20:01.450
No, that won't be necessary!

00:20:01.450 --> 00:20:03.640
We have to get Nishi's weight down,

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:07.010
so that he'll fit into those trunks when his match comes.

00:20:07.960 --> 00:20:10.810
We have a target to aim for now! Thank you!

00:20:10.810 --> 00:20:11.520
My...

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:16.560
Well then, why don't we take a picture of you two in your trunks?

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:19.750
All right, everyone line up!

00:20:19.750 --> 00:20:20.590
Okay.

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:24.240
Okay? Say "cheese"!

00:20:24.710 --> 00:20:26.740
Cheese!

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:32.250
Huh? I feel like we're missing someone...

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:33.560
Really?

00:20:35.110 --> 00:20:37.250
It's Joe! Where did he go?

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:40.760
He's in the gym doing somersaults!

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:42.760
Somersaults!?

00:20:49.530 --> 00:20:51.020
Yahoo!

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:07.330
Oh, please!

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:15.810
Come on, Nishi!

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:17.550
Go!

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:32.470
Oh, no!

00:21:43.690 --> 00:21:45.600
Yahoo!

00:21:45.820 --> 00:21:47.870
Yahoo!

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:54.710
Ever since I was born...

00:21:54.710 --> 00:21:59.380
I have always been denied everything. But now I will seize my dream with these two hands...

00:22:00.260 --> 00:22:03.320
For the time being, I've been able to set them on the right track.

00:22:03.320 --> 00:22:06.180
Here in this tiny gym, deep in the slums...

00:22:06.180 --> 00:22:10.310
these two boxers I have trained in sweat and grime...

00:22:11.370 --> 00:22:14.790
are finally going to enter the glorious ring!

00:23:42.300 --> 00:23:45.150
Joe, who paved a path where there was none,

00:23:45.150 --> 00:23:50.070
has finally come to the point where he is welcomed into the ring!

00:23:50.070 --> 00:23:54.170
As the ring lights shine upon you as you lap up the roaring applause...

00:23:54.170 --> 00:23:57.920
Joe, this day, this night, is for you!

00:23:57.920 --> 00:24:01.380
Now, for Joe, who walks the shining path towards the ring,

00:24:01.380 --> 00:24:03.090
which way is tomorrow?
